<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>System Alert</title>
</head>
<body style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 1.6; color: #333; max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 20px;">
  <div style="background-color: #f4f4f4; padding: 20px; border-radius: 5px;">
    <h1 style="color: #e74c3c; margin-top: 0;">⚠️ System Alert</h1>

    <p>Hi {{userName}},</p>

    <p>We're sending you this notification regarding an important system event that requires your attention.</p>

    <div style="background-color: #fff; padding: 15px; margin: 20px 0; border-left: 4px solid #e74c3c;">
      <p style="margin: 0;"><strong>Alert Type:</strong> {{alertType}}</p>
      <p style="margin: 10px 0 0 0;"><strong>Severity:</strong> <span style="color: {{#eq severity 'high'}}#e74c3c{{else}}{{#eq severity 'medium'}}#f39c12{{else}}#3498db{{/eq}}{{/eq}}; font-weight: bold;">{{uppercase severity}}</span></p>
      <p style="margin: 10px 0 0 0;"><strong>Time:</strong> {{formatDate timestamp}}</p>
    </div>

    <div style="background-color: #fff; padding: 15px; margin: 20px 0; border-radius: 5px;">
      <h3 style="margin-top: 0; color: #2c3e50;">Details:</h3>
      <p style="margin: 0;">{{message}}</p>
    </div>

    {{#if actionRequired}}
    <div style="background-color: #ffebee; border-left: 4px solid #e74c3c; padding: 15px; margin: 20px 0;">
      <p style="margin: 0; color: #c62828;"><strong>Action Required:</strong> {{actionRequired}}</p>
    </div>

    <div style="text-align: center; margin: 30px 0;">
      <a href="{{actionUrl}}" style="display: inline-block; background-color: #e74c3c; color: #fff; padding: 12px 30px; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 5px; font-weight: bold;">Take Action</a>
    </div>
    {{/if}}

    <p style="color: #7f8c8d; font-size: 14px;">
      If you believe this alert was sent in error or have questions, please contact our support team immediately.
    </p>

    <hr style="border: none; border-top: 1px solid #ddd; margin: 30px 0;">

    <p style="color: #7f8c8d; font-size: 12px; text-align: center;">
      This is an automated system notification. Please do not reply to this email.
    </p>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
